---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import Studio from '../components/Studio.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About the studio"
  description="Outer Join is Tom Bernaerd’s independent software studio in Belgium. Hands-on SAP Business One and Produmex experience, applied to focused integrated applications."
>
  <PageIntro
    label="About Outer Join"
    title="Independent development. Integrated thinking."
    description="A small software studio in Belgium, building focused applications for the work that happens around your business systems."
  />
  <Studio />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap editorial-split">
      <h2>
        Close to the process.
        <br />
        Hands-on with the software.
      </h2>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          My work has taken me through warehouse implementations, business
          software, eCommerce and IT infrastructure. Working with Produmex WMS
          and SAP Business One has taught me how much depends on the details
          between systems.
        </p>
        <p>
          Today, Outer Join brings that experience into bespoke web applications
          and connected workflows. You work directly with the person
          understanding the process, making the technical decisions and building
          the application.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alongside development, I help with focused integration and technical
          consulting. The aim is useful software that fits the way your business
          operates.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CTA />
</BaseLayout>
